stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Unloaded
    Unloaded --> Selecting: selectedModel changed
    Selecting --> LoadingManifest: allocate new load generation
    LoadingManifest --> LoadingMoc: model3.json accepted
    LoadingManifest --> LoadFailed: manifest/network/schema error
    LoadingMoc --> LoadingTextures: moc3/model instance accepted
    LoadingMoc --> LoadFailed: moc3/Core error
    LoadingTextures --> LoadingResources: required textures ready
    LoadingTextures --> LoadFailed: texture generation error
    LoadingResources --> Ready: physics/pose/motions/expressions/profile bound
    LoadingResources --> LoadFailed: required resource invalid

    Ready --> Running: renderer frame loop owns model
    Running --> Running: base snapshot / Parameter Mixer / physics / input
    Ready --> Replacing: selectedModel changed
    Running --> Replacing: selectedModel changed
    LoadingManifest --> Cancelled: newer generation selected
    LoadingMoc --> Cancelled: newer generation selected
    LoadingTextures --> Cancelled: newer generation selected
    LoadingResources --> Cancelled: newer generation selected

    Replacing --> CancellingOld: invalidate old generation token
    CancellingOld --> StoppingRuns: stop exact active motion/lip-sync resources
    StoppingRuns --> DisposingRenderer: detach frame ownership
    DisposingRenderer --> DisposingModel: release Cubism model/managers/textures
    DisposingModel --> Selecting: begin new selected generation

    Cancelled --> DisposingPartial: release only resources owned by stale generation
    DisposingPartial --> Selecting: latest selection still pending

    Running --> Disposing: app scope dispose / renderer shutdown
    Ready --> Disposing: app scope dispose / renderer shutdown
    LoadFailed --> Unloaded: failure reported, explicit retry required
    Disposing --> [*]

    state Running {
        [*] --> FrameScheduled
        FrameScheduled --> ValidateOwnership: requestAnimationFrame tick
        ValidateOwnership --> RestoreParameters: generation/model still current
        ValidateOwnership --> FrameStopped: stale/released
        RestoreParameters --> ApplyNativeMotion: load saved Cubism parameters
        ApplyNativeMotion --> ApplyNativeEffects: catalog/idle motion then save
        ApplyNativeEffects --> ResolveActiveParameters: blink / expression / drag / breath
        ResolveActiveParameters --> ApplyPhysics: ActiveParameterRuntime<br/>Mixer 合成并完成唯一主动参数写入
        ApplyPhysics --> ApplyPose: Cubism Physics
        ApplyPose --> UpdateModel: Cubism Pose
        UpdateModel --> Render: model update / renderer
        Render --> FrameScheduled: next frame
        FrameStopped --> [*]
    }

    state "Async Callback Gate" as Gate {
        [*] --> CallbackArrives
        CallbackArrives --> Accepted: generation matches and model not released
        CallbackArrives --> Rejected: stale generation or released owner
        Accepted --> [*]
        Rejected --> [*]
    }

    note right of LoadingTextures
        Every model, texture and uncached-motion
        callback must carry generation ownership.
        A stale callback cannot touch SDK managers.
    end note

    note right of Replacing
        Invalidate ownership before Cubism dispose.
        Stop frame/audio/lip/motion callbacks before
        releasing the model they reference.
    end note

    note right of LoadFailed
        Do not silently retain a half-loaded model.
        Report the exact failed stage and require
        an explicit retry or new model selection.
    end note
